      "width": 1230.1,
      "height": 40.0,
      "text": "Note: The filled diamond is composition — when an Order goes away, its Order Items go with it.\nThe hollow triangle is inheritance, and the numbers are multiplicity. Unlike an ERD, the operations (behaviour) show up too.",
